# BUILDBUDS — NAVIGATION REFINEMENT, COMMUNITY DISCOVERY, CONTENT MANAGEMENT AND PUBLIC SHOWCASE INTEGRATION

## PROJECT INSTRUCTIONS

We are refining the existing Build Buds application.

The current application already has a main marketing homepage, a public community experience, a Discord-style private chat workspace, user profiles, authentication and administrative functionality.

The objective is to simplify the navigation, remove unnecessary visual elements, improve the separation between the main website and public community, and properly connect content shared inside the private chat to the public project showcase.

**IMPORTANT: This is an existing application. Do not rebuild it, replace its architecture or redesign working components unnecessarily. Inspect the existing repository and modify the appropriate components in place.**

Repository:
https://github.com/Jaystarbliss-studios/Buildbuds.git

Preserve the existing Firebase Authentication, Firestore database, Vercel deployment, PWA functionality, Build Buds logo and established brand identity.

The newly attached reference image should be used as the structural and layout reference for the public Community Discovery page. Reproduce its general composition, content organisation, visual hierarchy and discovery experience, but apply the official Build Buds identity.

Do not simply reproduce the reference image as a static screenshot.

Build a genuinely functional, responsive page.

